ave, dishwasher, and a massive granite island designed for entertaining against a lake backdrop. Bonus Sunroom & Outdoor Space: Temperature-controlled sunroom with dedicated wall A/C, large backyard deck, expansive yard, and the only private fishing/relaxing dock in the immediate neighborhood. Parking & Storage: Oversized driveway fitting up to 4 vehicles plus a 1-car garage. Unbeatably Convenient Location: Under 1 mile to the local elementary school; minutes to shopping, AdventHealth, dining, and a quick drive to Legoland. High-end lakefront rental opportunities at this price point do not last long. Contact us today to schedule your private tour!","age_restricted":false,"income_restricted":false,"flags":[],"min_rent":2050,"images":[{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/9a9595a27a5ef388b6a73abc01ba22cfl-m3704207973r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["house_view","patio","porch","yard","back_side","complete","exterior"],"primary":true,"origins":[{"kind":"primary"},{"kind":"listing"},{"kind":"api_gallery"}],"source_urls":["https://ap.rdcpix.com/9a9595a27a5ef388b6a73abc01ba22cfl-m3704207973s.jpg","https://ap.rdcpix.com/9a9595a27a5ef388b6a73abc01ba22cfl-m3704207973r.jpg"],"resolution_source":"API size:MAX"},{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/9a9595a27a5ef388b6a73abc01ba22cfl-m3489091192r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["aerial_view","water_view","exterior"],"primary":false,"origins":[{"kind":"listing"},{"kind":"api_gallery"}],"source_urls":["https://ap.rdcpix.com/9a9595a27a5ef388b6a73abc01ba22cfl-m3489091192s.jpg","https://ap.rdcpix.com/9a9595a27a5ef388b6a73abc01ba22cfl-m3489091192r.jpg"],"resolution_source":"API size:MAX"},{"url":"https://ap.rdcpix.com/9a9595a27a5ef388b6a73abc01ba22cfl-m1528134027r.jpg","title":null,"tags":["aerial_view","farm","water_view","exterior"],"primary":false,"origins":[{"kind":"listing"},{"kind":"api_gallery"}],"source_urls":["https://ap.rdcpix.com/9a9595a27a5ef388b6a73abc01ba22cfl-m1528134027s.jpg","https://ap.rdcpix.com/9a9595a27a5ef388b6a73abc01ba22cfl-m1528134027r.